  <item>
    <title>#155 AI蛋糕的第四层｜ RSI：AI开始制造AI</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac5daf0195d838e2aee16f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac5daf0195d838e2aee16f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:12:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【节目介绍】</span></p><p><span>如果AI不再只是回答问题，而是开始制造下一代AI，会发生什么？本期《科技慢半拍》，我们来到AI“五层蛋糕”的第四层——模型层，聊聊正在从思想实验走向现实的“递归式自我改进”（RSI）。从自己写代码、做实验，到修改自己的工作方式，AI正一步步接过研发的工具。但会修改自己，就等于能无限变强吗？当AI既当运动员，又想改写裁判的规则，人类该如何守住边界？这一期，我们一起拆解那台正在成形的“制造智能的机器”。⁠</span></p><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 引言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> AI的三个“摩尔定律”</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFUddYStNdpOIq30okIc8dgMXAY.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="583">09:43</a> RSI到底是什么：从图灵到古德，再从元学习到“起飞速度”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> AI设计AI的历史</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a> 从反思到递归：四个容易混淆的概念</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1505">25:05</a> RSI的五个等级和五块拼图</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgmrN6UtxKPtvjK7wo2iLgGSRYpe.png"><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 递归，一定会爆炸吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3176">52:56</a> 总结</span></p><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><ul><li><p><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11873" data-url="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.11873"><span>The Last AI Built by Humans: Toward Genuine Recursive Self-Improvement（人类造的最后一个AI：走向真正的递归式自我改进）</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://sakana.ai/dgm/" data-url="https://sakana.ai/dgm/"><span>The Darwin Gödel Machine: AI that improves itself by rewriting its own code（达尔文哥德尔机：通过改写自身代码实现自我改进的AI）</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://deepmind.google/blog/alphaevolve-a-gemini-powered-coding-agent-for-designing-advanced-algorithms/" data-url="https://deepmind.google/blog/alphaevolve-a-gemini-powered-coding-agent-for-designing-advanced-algorithms/"><span>AlphaEvolve: A Gemini-powered coding agent for designing advanced algorithms（AlphaEvolve：用Gemini设计先进算法的编程智能体）</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.09498" data-url="https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.09498"><span>Self-Harness: Harnesses That Improve Themselves（能够自我改进的工作框架）</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.02304" data-url="https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.02304"><span>Self-Taught Optimizer (STOP): Recursively Self-Improving Code Generation（自学优化器：递归式自我改进的代码生成）</span></a></p></li><li><p><a href="https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought" data-url="https://epoch.ai/publications/the-plunging-price-of-thought"><span>The Plunging Price of Thought（智能的价格正在暴跌）</span></a></p></li></ul><p><span>【片头片尾音乐】</span></p><p><a href="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=3433941406&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX185hdvZFxyamCFpf+FiNdmJQs8Nnd8Hvhg=" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/song?id=3433941406&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX185hdvZFxyamCFpf+FiNdmJQs8Nnd8Hvhg="><span>林子,袁顶顶 - 疯人院</span></a></p><p><span>【感谢】</span></p><p><span>特别感谢[AIGC开放社区]和[AI重塑世界]的大力支持，请听友及时订阅微信公众号，查看本播客的文字版内容。欢迎订阅本播客节目，本节目在小宇宙、喜马拉雅、苹果播客、蜻蜓FM、网易云音乐、荔枝FM等平台均已上线。</span></p>]]></description>
